    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>You coax better worlds to sprout in the cracks of the old.</em></p><p>Once per <strong>a Soma Break</strong>, when you lead or are a clear moral center of a <strong>non-lethal victory</strong> (surrender, rout, negotiated peace) in a hex marked by corruption, occupation, or high Darkness, you may trigger a Sephirothic Bloom.</p><ul><li>Reduce the relevant <strong>Darkness Track</strong> by <strong>1</strong> (local, regional, or campaign-scale as the GM deems appropriate).</li><li>Shift the affected Hex one step toward a <strong>beneficial Sephirah</strong> (GM chooses which, based on narrative: Tiferet, Chesed, etc.).</li></ul><p>This is the world briefly remembering it was supposed to be kind.</p>",
